  "text": "### 6.1 Audit Methodology  \n**Planning Phase:**\n- Define audit scope and objectives\n- Risk assessment for target process\n- Interview key personnel\n- Document process workflows\n- Identify key controls  \n**Fieldwork Phase:**\n- Test key controls (sample transaction review)\n- Conduct interviews\n- Analyze data and findings\n- Document evidence\n- Assess control effectiveness  \n**Reporting Phase:**\n- Draft audit report (findings, conclusions)\n- Present findings to management\n- Management response and action plan\n- Final report issued\n- Executive summary to Board Audit Committee  \n**Follow-Up Phase:**\n- Monitor management's remediation progress\n- Re-test key controls (if major findings)\n- Quarterly status update to Board Audit Committee",
